config BR2_PACKAGE_FONT_FIRA
	bool "font-fira"
	help
	  Mozilla's Fira Sans (all weights and italics) and Fira Mono:
	  the interface and monospace fonts COSMIC is designed around
	  (libcosmic's defaults). Without them COSMIC falls back to
	  whatever fontconfig finds.

	  https://github.com/mozilla/Fira
